## 7. Autologin & language

- [ ] Wire CAPTCHA solve into the login pipeline (solver exists; stages do not call it)
- [ ] Game-language calibrations for Japanese (UI offers JA; shop/HUD clicks are ko/zh only)
- [ ] Document or fix Chinese shop-click X still using Korean UV

---

## 8. Engine stubs / cleanup

- [ ] Replace blackboard `is_walkable` stub with real terrain checks (or delete unused path)
- [ ] Hotbar: decide whether class skill checkboxes override role map, or drop those UI rows
- [ ] Remove or gray out Draft-only fields until the matching logic exists (reduces false confidence)

---

## Suggested order

1. [ ] Schedule executor + account/slot wiring  
2. [ ] Expand `apply_runtime_settings` (adapter) for every setting you keep  
3. [ ] Town / bag loop (sell, repair, restock, weight return)  
4. [ ] Combat modes (keep-distance, fallback, class policies)  
5. [ ] Recovery flags + budget  
6. [ ] Dungeon packs / CAPTCHA / language polish  

---

## Notes

- **Draft** in the schedule UI means “saved only; no timer.” That stays true until §1 is done.
- Prefer wiring a control **or** hiding it — leaving live-looking toggles that do nothing is the main UX risk.
- Core farm loop that **does** work today: farms/patrol, hotbar scan, potions/escape, Mother Tree, talking-scroll shop for arrows, loot filters, death restart, game-closed relogin (when account exists).
